      Rational[8, 15]] $CellContext`r^5 $CellContext`\[Omega]^5, Complex[0, 
       Rational[-8, 5]] (
      Complex[0, -2] + $CellContext`a) $CellContext`r^3 \
$CellContext`\[Omega]^4 + 
